[38;5;16m[48;5;153m ☐ Approach [39m[49m

[1m[38;5;231mWhich notification architecture should we design around?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mC: Derived + ledger (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mVisible list computed from tasks; small persisted ledger for once-only delivery and read state.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: Materialized store
     [38;5;246mPersisted notification records appended by a scheduler. Real history; dedup and orphans to solve.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m A: Pure projection
     [38;5;246mFewest moving parts. No memory, so no reliable once-only OS toasts and no read state.[39m
